 envato-kit-138-bracket elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d776561\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Experience our Career Development Platform<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e94dd2f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e94dd2f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>AIT provides its students extensive career development resources covering all career fields and professions. Our students are encouraged to access these resources to guide them on their future career choices and decisions. Prior to admission to AIT our prospective students also access these resources to guide them on the choice of their academic programs with their future career intentions in mind. At AIT we do believe that decisions that will have a major impact on one\u2019s future must be well-informed. The AIT\u2019s Career Development and Advancement Resources do enable our students to make well-informed career choice decisions.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Experience Our Extensive PhD Research Resources AIT is a leading PhD research university offering PhD programs in Engineering, Business, Management, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default",